So within Neo4j Desktop, let's create a new project.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:46.540
I'm going to call this project Sample Project.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.420
Then let's create a new database.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:57.620
I'm going to name my Neo4j Database Company DB.

